&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager, Talent &amp;amp; Performance&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;San Mateo, CA or New York, NY&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;| Hybrid -&lt;strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;2 days per week in designated location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to:&lt;/strong&gt; Director, Talent Management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;517&quot; data-end=&quot;716&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note, this is a senior individual contributor role with enterprise-wide scope and no direct reports. Success will come through deep subject matter expertise, influence, and cross-functional leadership.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-section-id=&quot;u5tw7s&quot; data-start=&quot;718&quot; data-end=&quot;733&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Mission:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;735&quot; data-end=&quot;998&quot;&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment is redefining the future of gaming, and we believe that future is powered by people. As &lt;strong data-start=&quot;854&quot; data-end=&quot;894&quot;&gt;Senior Manager, Talent &amp;amp; Performance&lt;/strong&gt;, you will lead the continued evolution of Game Changers, SIE’s global performance management framework.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1000&quot; data-end=&quot;1273&quot;&gt;You’ll connect performance with our broader talent ecosystem, including succession planning, calibration, promotions, and career development, ensuring our people processes are tightly aligned to strategic business outcomes, leadership behaviors, and a culture of development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1275&quot; data-end=&quot;1593&quot;&gt;You’ll bring deep Talent &amp;amp; Performance expertise, strategic judgment, and operational horsepower. You’ll independently assess what’s working, identify where we need to evolve, shape recommendations, and build alignment with senior stakeholders, while remaining close enough to the work to drive excellent execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1595&quot; data-end=&quot;1736&quot;&gt;This is an opportunity for someone who enjoys operating at both levels: setting direction and rolling up their sleeves to make it happen!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-section-id=&quot;1gr9ak9&quot; data-start=&quot;1738&quot; data-end=&quot;1761&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1763&quot; data-end=&quot;4445&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1bi47zc&quot; data-start=&quot;1763&quot; data-end=&quot;1966&quot;&gt;Lead and continuously evolve Game Changers, SIE’s enterprise-wide performance program supporting 10,000+ employees globally, with a focus on clarity, fairness, differentiation, and business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1vff6lp&quot; data-start=&quot;1967&quot; data-end=&quot;2192&quot;&gt;Act as a subject matter expert and accountable program owner for enterprise performance management, bringing informed recommendations and a clear point of view while remaining open to challenge, feedback, and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1opz11d&quot; data-start=&quot;2193&quot; data-end=&quot;2361&quot;&gt;Design, evolve, and implement performance frameworks that enable meaningful differentiation, clear goal alignment, continuous feedback, and values-driven development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;g9b2x3&quot; data-start=&quot;2362&quot; data-end=&quot;2544&quot;&gt;Connect performance with the broader talent ecosystem, including calibration, talent reviews, succession planning, promotions, career development, 9-box, and internal mobility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1upztvu&quot; data-start=&quot;2545&quot; data-end=&quot;2711&quot;&gt;Assess organizational context, business needs, culture, maturity, and readiness for change before recommending how our Talent &amp;amp; Performance practices should evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ueb8x2&quot; data-start=&quot;2712&quot; data-end=&quot;2947&quot;&gt;Translate strategy into execution, personally getting into the details required to successfully deliver enterprise programs, from program design and governance through communications, enablement, technology, adoption, and measurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;78vyxm&quot; data-start=&quot;2948&quot; data-end=&quot;3116&quot;&gt;Influence and challenge senior leaders, navigate competing priorities, and create alignment across complex stakeholder groups without relying on formal authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;jmnfdc&quot; data-start=&quot;3117&quot; data-end=&quot;3292&quot;&gt;Partner closely with HRBPs, Rewards, L&amp;amp;D, People Technology &amp;amp; Services, People Analytics, business leaders, and other People teams to develop scalable, integrated solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;s6m9v1&quot; data-start=&quot;3293&quot; data-end=&quot;3500&quot;&gt;Oversee the adoption and optimization of BetterWorks across performance, feedback, calibration, and talent review processes, including workflows, tools, reporting, and emerging AI-assisted capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;npqs5s&quot; data-start=&quot;3501&quot; data-end=&quot;3702&quot;&gt;Apply behavioral science, employee insights, and talent data to identify opportunities, inform recommendations, and improve performance transparency, manager effectiveness, and leadership capability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;b403ba&quot; data-start=&quot;3703&quot; data-end=&quot;3896&quot;&gt;Build scalable performance enablement resources - including manager tools, communications, training, and guidance - that translate our performance philosophy into meaningful day-to-day behaviors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1nn8zgj&quot; data-start=&quot;3897&quot; data-end=&quot;4036&quot;&gt;Partner with People Brand and Communications to ensure performance messaging is clear, consistent, and drives understanding and adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;e38c8p&quot; data-start=&quot;4037&quot; data-end=&quot;4259&quot;&gt;Monitor performance health metrics, calibration patterns, adoption, and talent outcomes, translating data into actionable insights and recommendations for senior stakeholders, including the CHRO and executive leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;10jk8ac&quot; data-start=&quot;4260&quot; data-end=&quot;4445&quot;&gt;Continuously evaluate external practices, emerging technology, AI capabilities, and future-of-work trends to identify opportunities to strengthen SIE’s Talent &amp;amp; Performance ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-section-id=&quot;fde1zp&quot; data-start=&quot;4447&quot; data-end=&quot;4471&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We’re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;t4819g&quot; data-start=&quot;1891&quot; data-end=&quot;2184&quot;&gt;Demonstrated depth in Talent Management and Performance, with experience owning complex, enterprise-wide programs in a large, global, matrixed organization. You’ve operated with the autonomy, judgment, and influence required to shape direction, not simply execute an established approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;yfazaa&quot; data-start=&quot;2185&quot; data-end=&quot;2420&quot;&gt;Proven experience owning, designing, evolving, and executing enterprise-wide performance management programs, with meaningful experience across calibration, talent reviews, succession planning, promotions, and career development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;jhargf&quot; data-start=&quot;2421&quot; data-end=&quot;2587&quot;&gt;Experience navigating global complexity, including partnering across regions, functions, and senior stakeholder groups to drive enterprise-wide talent outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1cend&quot; data-start=&quot;2588&quot; data-end=&quot;2781&quot;&gt;Deep Talent &amp;amp; Performance expertise with the ability to bring a clear point of view, diagnose opportunities, challenge existing approaches, and translate strategy into scalable execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;171nf0p&quot; data-start=&quot;5263&quot; data-end=&quot;5463&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to influence and challenge senior leaders, navigate competing priorities, and create alignment across complex stakeholder groups spanning levels, functions, and geographies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;e6dfyz&quot; data-start=&quot;5464&quot; data-end=&quot;5687&quot;&gt;Strong organizational and contextual judgment - you understand that the right solution depends on the business, culture, organizational maturity, and readiness for change rather than simply applying external best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;17bc23j&quot; data-start=&quot;5688&quot; data-end=&quot;5863&quot;&gt;Experience leading through influence and successfully driving outcomes in environments where decision-making and accountability are distributed across multiple stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;8u2d5u&quot; data-start=&quot;5864&quot; data-end=&quot;6034&quot;&gt;Strong change leadership capabilities, with demonstrated success building stakeholder commitment and driving adoption of new or evolving Talent &amp;amp; Performance practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pu0tdk&quot; data-start=&quot;6035&quot; data-end=&quot;6227&quot;&gt;Data-literate and deeply curious - you use analytics, stakeholder feedback, employee insights, and external trends to form recommendations, test assumptions, and continuously improve outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i95mp8&quot; data-start=&quot;6228&quot; data-end=&quot;6423&quot;&gt;Experience leveraging HR technology to enable enterprise Talent &amp;amp; Performance processes; experience with BetterWorks or comparable performance/talent platforms is valuable but not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1445q7m&quot; data-start=&quot;6424&quot; data-end=&quot;6620&quot;&gt;Comfortable exploring how emerging technologies, including AI, can improve manager effectiveness, employee experience, decision quality, and the scalability of Talent &amp;amp; Performance programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;p6dgs5&quot; data-start=&quot;6621&quot; data-end=&quot;6777&quot;&gt;Executive presence and communication skills that allow you to translate complex talent concepts into clear, compelling recommendations for senior leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;uyepcn&quot; data-start=&quot;6778&quot; data-end=&quot;6927&quot;&gt;A deep commitment to equity, transparency, employee growth, and creating talent practices that strengthen both individual and business performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;#LI-SF1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At SIE, we consider several factors when setting each role’s base pay range, including the competitive benchmarking data for the market and geographic location.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please note that the base pay range may vary in line with our hybrid working policy and individual base pay will be determined based on job-related factors which may include knowledge, skills, experience, and location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;In addition, this role &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;is eligible&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; for SIE’s top-tier benefits package that includes medical, dental, vision, matching 401(k), paid time off, wellness program and coveted employee discounts for Sony products. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This role also may be eligible for a bonus package.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Click&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.playstation.com/benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; to learn more.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The estimated base pay range for this role is listed below.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$186,600&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$279,800 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note, Sony Interactive Entertainment conducts background checks at the offer stage for all new employees (which may include criminal background checks for some roles) and will need to process personal information to support these checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.playstation.com/legal/careers-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information about what personal information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and your data protection rights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All persons will receive consideration for employment without regard to gender (including gender identity, gender expression and gender reassignment), race (including colour, nationality, ethnic or national origin), religion or belief, marital or civil partnership status, disability, age, sexual orientation, pregnancy, maternity or parental status, trade union membership or membership in any other legally protected category.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We strive to create an inclusive environment, empower employees and embrace diversity. We encourage everyone to respond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment is a Fair Chance employer and qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records will be considered for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
